WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Truly all these images are made out of relationship and couldn't be made otherwise.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.720
The other piece I'm thinking about is that little sort of cartoony image I made with

00:15.680 --> 00:24.800
Sins and Valid during one of the Sultangaza. It says disability justice means resisting together

00:24.800 --> 00:33.600
from solitary cells to open air prisons to exist is to resist. There's so much devastation here but

00:33.600 --> 00:41.200
that's not what you see you see the hands. Right and the good is truly the goal and hope of my

00:41.200 --> 00:49.760
work is to be in service and solidarity and love with the people who are most targeted by these

00:49.760 --> 00:59.040
systems. So then because they have taught me so much. You know as I just worked there there are many

00:59.040 --> 01:07.440
times when also I've had to confront the ways that I really haven't shown up for other oppressed

01:07.440 --> 01:12.720
communities that are so close to me, you know, including intersex folks, including other disabled

01:13.440 --> 01:21.440
after I became more disabled. I of course sadly went back and started understanding all my work

01:21.440 --> 01:28.240
through a disability justice lens. And so this image was a rapid response piece. It was made by

01:28.240 --> 01:34.000
myself in Paddyburn because we're family and just hanging out her house when I talking about,

01:34.000 --> 01:41.120
you know, how hard broken and outrage we are about the genocide in Gaza and the way that Gaza is

01:41.120 --> 01:48.640
an open air prison and the the ways that our police forces and military are intertwined with that

01:48.640 --> 01:58.080
apartheid state and the ways that all of these carceral systems are disabling. Then I see that many

01:58.080 --> 02:03.600
people use it in an academic setting and serve to talk about these these big concepts

02:03.680 --> 02:15.680
of connecting abolition to colonization apartheid and militarization. So this I think this is another one

02:15.680 --> 02:16.400
that I'm proud of.

